  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "鳥鳴喈喈，天火將下。燔我屋室，災及妃后。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5c9b6dbdc8fe3df2b64b10ffa69fb70e45cb86e8cd06b0c6a74ad364745e283a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5fffb10c4b21bb9a4f2f62b6131ce2bd10c81f13c7b49bb5478991932ac6da30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "黃虹之野，賢君所在。管仲為相，國無災咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1d391a48803130f3418530ea8f04ba108fddb7889774763cdfbd1f0921e31734",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78878e811713554bbd20da6f40aa994463cd972d3012635320e30b5b7eb3e8d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "叔梁有名，相與合齒。乾坤利貞，乳生六子。長大成就，風言如母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb183ebf4d26b6b5b4e45352125056687d48480ad29a30cbb6c29790b81f1b0d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:de65a223a92d1d1efffe8fa258644922c460c3cbe965a98414a1b41888bdbccd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "蝗囓我稻，驅不可去。實穗無有，但見空槁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f63ae7c3ca2fa3cd6629c59801f8e154a3184222cac7d4e6452ac0f12e9d31f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c96e34c2379dfb0824aa88f3fa711b824953ddef473e37f5cfaeaaaf4b7e4e48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "嬰孩求乳，母歸其子，黃麑悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4a577b8bd9a12c37795e3b590b52fd427fdfec2b1fb5fb5814de2e7440a3b7d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8cddad1bfeace0cbea354cba37c5424375c91bae22b0d59df7577cc9c7f2c648"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "折箬蔽目，不見稚叔。失旅亡民，遠去家室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:76c40ee425c4d421eebb9da38646944859c4774062e93a329d06fe8a19d21f66",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5849726e1a44556ac64ab67c4e3b6a67e8f3ca5e7bbf2b3245a807c47ca9dd82"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "牂羊羵首，君子不飽。年饑孔荒，士民危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:014ed9ba42976d2b71f5e129c0687e43155b3813a63aa805120bdb11cf793797",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e4baf0d5c2e5505d3e02d7625f01de38d0b11e4363c54f44100dd13a3b95a496"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "靈龜陸處，盤桓失所。伊子退耕，桀亂無輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ca1a4a7f880ae400c3d3a16f27d2586790ba44a3bc928a7d8a096910cea9c140",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df271d19d8090d7303aba15863136d66e3d47ec2bd88c3d274221890b5286552"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "威約拘囚，為人所誣。皋陶平理，幾得脫免。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:237c122a2157c24b27c3bef7ba01593ef4eb375af4f9e986a2cb663ac8c3406e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5aa8514bdc6be6c15c63dae67e9f695f4d9bf2cfd2c195e152db11820a8b7cfe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "烏升鵲舉，照臨東海。龍降庭堅，為陶叔後。封於蓼丘，福履綏厚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f8a10499d157bbc88a0fed98c8e5db53399225bcabce3a08b80933420df4579",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:375c83ba30131ca0177ba8ab135e222ab0eecc8f8cbfdeef5f52d0c349d3158b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "四目相視，稍延同埶。日映之後，見吾伯姊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e6c6f72419128f24025dc5bf1342ed30bced22f4414e7a1957f92616a9e2a709",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0357afcc81554c469a05185338c8d38f767f0e4c4299ff57d11c28038110d2fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "大步上車，南至喜家。送我狐裘，與福載來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f17bc398a92e8b374e3aa4454ff0330801e50ca65d9d9406ab0d76f78cdd6758",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:76595a17a024d99f9d9a4a77462c7d910fd21fca5bb3fd6a6262394d8f95445b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "穿都相合，未敢面見。媒妁無良，使我不鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f7e6597648726115019fef80b3cf3ba278ed519e5519c3f16e2c682239b9011",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bff6e02425dec47bedc2118ec16cf4b37ab045c740112ab645332a079d4efc7f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "鴻飛遵陸，公母不復，伯氏客宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:166ba229b159248575c54dbcae337c891730b5b0df84004c5f1060393c2c416a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c304bd1c667851b6ab4562c0779b6b7b99d185601c359f68555424ff39f603a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "代戍失期，患至無聊。懼以發難，為我開基，邦國憂愁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4cfccfe545cbd46435203f7b352514cbd0cec8edaf4f08d2abc3ae4edfffb42",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be8916994dbb4e3d71eceb9231efc4c8057f730a40e99093fa2c8c40d1f7524f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "伯氏爭言，戰於龍門。搆怨結禍，三世不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:984993aa09c36e3b6bb07cba1ad4debac7baf05caa86f3c47ff7187d68ad6dd4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1b6c762ef954d2291f8180476ae50f758f3f57d6a206511d797b680cf78a12f2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "周政養賊，背生人足。陸行不安，國危為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f73652790624a0d5e2740198665efb4428971b0e63a548b02d03a107062cdccd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:95f7e9cbd523184fd561d07b9cd99a263d5d6be472189c1719fbb9bbf179d6d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "蜩螗歡喜，草木嘉茂。百果蕃生，日增富有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e19dec776ff9b24febad47915e82fc873b581ca4e30f9fe575a22b0dc9d1ae8c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fdd46bea8cc1f2a544d3f6e1159086c15845e5a5a5188aaadb9220abaa302f30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "薄災暴虎，風吹雲卻。欲上不得，復歸其宅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a67c0efc150bc9e8e6b6b16bcf4919781f78a69a52869a562abff60150480cb9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:24f525984147f3137c4aefaf50ef05eaa614527f15d4efc612dbe3ca1e1d6edc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "乘騮駕驪，遊至東齊。遭遇行旅，送我以貨，厚得利歸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:56b37783d325fa73b2310e3a6bb23c1e2db5a589320e31617693db838411f3d4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4e575521be2b66f5a86c1733a385871bfc8bab9c82e64f09a8243fe9cf04c882"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "鳳生十子，同巢共乳，歡悅相保。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d59af8e3d588fdb91adc1fc0fa8632201edd71deb1c194e3669b29ab6d8fb4a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2017703b244839929729e9ef6ccba2d23c7f6d1b33857a8ee5547562bf19465b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "桃雀竊脂，巢於小枝。動搖不安，為風所吹。心寒慄搖，常憂殆危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:15e136b51912480fa79c6c109487b18d2a26186ea01f9349518c727f233a5aaa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:488dc545f8a3d2859b23b70e472d9259611759c528bcaca3e98c6e57f2a575e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "東山西山，各自止安。雖相登望，不得同堂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:74f6bf7a80b34966ceec0a975a361cd9ef2bc934641377df67566e525c85a719",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a06408557bc93e19e1e9d66f9fcd6974d291266b5a746172171fc6169f293f3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "匍匐出走，驚懼皇恐。白虎生孫，蓐收在後。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6b788656a1855490e75ec0144edfc35b640a0f629ce4b825c472cb793d45c97d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:109c90a58d703b611c8fc9ea13900704efa15e63cc57e30a5c1b36fb77473fd3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "重弋射隼，不知所定。質疑蓍龜，告以肥牡。明神答報，宜利止居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3b2043855c2cbd969548d2f98fec445055bda9c1c57cafe1cc2bbbbde025813c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f535072bc253afb85211c34775f19fad561ec05aff6c5055d0e5db583b5aeff1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "開門內福，喜至我側。加以善祥，為吾家宅。宮城洛邑，以昭文德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3db075bda9c99837635f1cd4627185581cf287ea8ba645149966103c3cee6249",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:64566fea7da457890ade0229128e8b588866c1e9c71ddf8536ce26eb4eadfdcf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "烏飛狐鳴，國亂不寧。下強上弱，為陰所刑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a8a2255a01b7bdce806f2afa27c816542cac81e1edf25269001a65a434e49e21",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b850b8a1cacb85b49e0b8ab1be22517fe6d9ca33cc469bc894c8936ee04f1eab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "三雞啄粟，八雛從食。飢鷹卒擊，失亡兩叔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7694f0c90cd9738990927751703ee6f4ff6ea8d57b8488f0a34370fa7d4fb4a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bc16b3bcda54a76b84290398902fd62699dbbd91c579a43fa32f5a2e9ce9ced6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "歎息不悅，憂逆中出。喪我金罌，無妄失位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6c709aef1271e92c711cf4e0e4e868cf615a321fd3e6ee98461b86de5b98242",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d4a46763bfaa1ec463a975d5ea2289ef5446fab220427a24497c84142f870d48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "剛柔相呼，二姓為家。霜降既同，惠我以仁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2072190a02af15f1cbe7b3be20aadf178d37de290801823e769aaf3b4f9d701f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0e7bee824993c1d1d4f602f34c067bf30ead539dcd1e89621392e89cdb579e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "送我季女，至於蕩道。齊子旦夕，留連久處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c761153602efaf7b222c5f33c84f9c4a8e3688effdefb71126ebcd6e3673e044",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:371578006508c163c29abc49d8f7a636b36067cc8be7166d292049dbd7eed235"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "低頭竊視，有所畏避。行作不利，酒酸魚敗，眾莫貪嗜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:462113e8c11db99f644eae550cda62a69a18583d58252a4fb97d50301ac8aa8a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4afef86fc92b442df37ac5fceb92ba90615b69005857b05723eca9d8a9dccc7a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "典策法書，藏在蘭臺。雖遭亂潰，獨不遇災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc15cf3e143cf7b7ef65e48264d54d93329fcc736f0627cd4aaf98a06393cac6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be36e5ebf25f773b5e951089ae0c92dd7c68a58dcbf521920f637b0ca73d6756"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "旦醉病酒，暮即瘳愈，獨不及咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:11b5741237265918530b9e75d17f492b99177b9e34c7772703a4d2c4f177fb7d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7dad4c9290d27569c4ce8b9ee4431bff549735a7d2ddf07daf1ad8c74a8b2baa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "畫龍頭頸，文章不成。甘言美語，說辭不名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2a2a9b7e8b98503a46afdaee40d4bdf4a94d74dcbd2f8128d847f9f7e6ab8d28",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bff3d501d0c3296f64366035cb37173b9c5bf2ac92b80e269f97cd3eec631ac2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "日月運行，一寒一暑。榮光赫赫，不可得保。顛躓殞墜，更為士伍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a551833319bd607a9c834a77d8163835d06918f40dcc0efac21d732be850e9ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae246f04eff1656466bbb7a253daa9ebc926e32ca8158267ccc6843b81fb9b9a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "爭利王市，朝多君子。蘇氏六國，獲其榮寵。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d08877e10073032620e3c4592a70c1bbf664a7ac6e7966a52712d46df3182fb5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2dcdb07787b78f014ec2f6480b10c8dd415bbbadf5a4cc085e71ffa1d0ceb929"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "六蛇奔走，俱入茂草。驚於長塗，畏懼啄口。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7ca1dad5c83f5c5188f93ad954367a893416bb94f0b3056254912f751b38c4d1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3e62386308c9ee4a86e3c2220e0edb67996752210bb62203cb8d0472ae9b62a1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "懸狟素餐，食非其任。失輿剝廬，休坐徙居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:624fe0a62a726538467f54af7d8efd7f2c1659bcbfbe00bcf17ad3bbb62d8e5e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3b6d21632b24bf53509f2078bb80abf83354f6900652bb46f281b3314ebdc26e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "歡欣九子，俱見大喜。攜提福至，王孫是富。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5cde7c43e50a540b2eeb4cdf7c491c3da5440cacda0b01cff7c972dbc65197f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:286e4b3920eea6a6a7a7e4528ccaa3d3b9d2b1f5091980a86ce114f065e6d011"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "伯夷叔齊，貞廉之師。以德防患，憂禍不存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:63788214b3ac76a95d77981794d7a6302a4054a2d1424a3e4297ba08e5a0a09a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78260c95cc8c3ad07b201a3259bd620299db12966d2d2aa4d9aab51fc9ea6943"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "雄聖伏名，人匿麟驚。走鳳飛北，亂潰未息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:374c670ff9619474a342e7dd53da40b2cb17a66b6926b39a648b9cbef5a40de8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd1872426e32a1d23080cf7058c30f9247ebf96d638ae8c08bcf0f98ae9f392f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "久鰥無偶，思配織女。求其非望，自令寡處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c16c8d9d9aa4915160cb0f81a39b45c4d89b882cc5f8038cddd6fd9198d27705",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:76a91f6e30f7fef94d4613e6e7a9f97beb02c1ce4cd958341e89fea88b7540fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "破亡之國，天所不福，難以止息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b910214ac3bb0f3255008268b13c033b21ecbf2145464f959350d50fac989e1d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf1c42141859602b327b66329d94857a3cf382f3cb47afcae9ceb7864f4dcabd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "老慵多欲，弊政為賊。阿房驪山，子嬰失國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:580b60f55c3dbfe871123f87e1821da377efd684a6f3b2832e2febbb351e1456",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5a6f608e4df36786324ee757d0568617d651f6e385933e28e297a847f97ee4a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "三羖六牂，相隨俱行。迷入空澤，經涉虎廬。為所傷賊，死於牙腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:77a868b21dcd2ada6bd2803bab91989e6f1fe7b09834ba30d7fc1ca69df23b5f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ea984ce4f3d2a5280bc101339517774a45af60cb595c69fe077d8b1877a41c1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "噬囁噱嚾，昧冥相搏。多言少實，語無成事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2820ff3ab8a75c20635ba06fc2a2c7110f329869619964e4b63ec3bff2150282",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c1a808f7f681d63decb7f907c52649ded96aca75a5cff2e8ae8b800ea4351dab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "舞陽漸離，擊筑善歌。慕丹之義，為燕荊軻。陰謀不遂，霍目死亡，功名何施。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9674e9b7402582e7288b335e2ebd7d91b3124e473cbcd3004f5eb73d7cc58f47",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e9f474be37bae35609ca3e24bb4ce8ec0316e8105f9dba5ec89bf8d0f09e41cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "尹氏伯奇，父子分離。無罪被辜，長舌為災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:76b67ecc37de264d7f7e7795eac353c7e31598dd80bc814b0d654f9d72f87c1f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e9a338ff720cbf86d8b4184a142d1982d82568f4487d4aae8a56a1f4a4d32ea0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "五精亂行，政逆皇恩。湯武赫怒，天伐利域。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cfcba18ca4c4304793aacfe378c399699152fcfeba14f935917c70b627596901",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71f7744e64c927906aa990754c13eef9c74c7de74a95807c50a42de6107417eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "西歷玉山，東入玉門。登上福堂，飲萬歲漿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8181bd71a66218e51ce6c9b1b90307fe31f29b5d1fc5a14fe3e9d75d1038446c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae47d262c6db617fa36329f6a8715d39e76f7c07f295ad8bd5abcd8147e1cb34"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "行觸忌諱，與司命忤。執囚束縛，拘制於吏，迷人有喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d77832bb9ee0f84764f29b25a99fa38d8fe4c8e4eb5b2ebc99d7e10c4d3669bf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5c351012e4f7726f59092146b3167ecb65c60607972396e78b53128bfcdc7b14"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "機父不賢，朝多讒臣。君失其政，保我久貧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:61d7ccb07160c684ff296104edd44cf02df7363795878a3a23b58962ad29b875",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:61f3253cb6fbb204f51fdad5d3f62461eec8f2751115b8de5da220a5fb593346"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "三人俱行，北求大牂。孟長病足，倩季負囊。柳下之貞，不失我邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:69a309efec3adca609d255c643e62eeb74e490f830a8dbd2abd13706d2b6a296",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e37085cb8b193e5681e417351821ad5e902e97af08b149ce05518825278f7673"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "鵠思其雄，欲隨鳳東。順理羽翼，出次日中。雖留比邑，復歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:acf7756a0453db1bdadd3330bd61c48f9d941addf009ad851ca880742befb535",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:691ddfe64c9606ae61e0fdccb3a837c04755147eb2d609ad4719adc941d6a32d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "常德自如，不逢禍災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d559b3acbd202dbab0d21c324566c3cd3a8b77438dbca57fe0c5cfcea668137a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:875c0d10f1e9192b3f6d0bec3a31ace467b00c2a3ef52a1b5d1112a04da5dbee"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "白鵠遊望，君子以寧。履德不愆，福祿來成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:54d6fd29f828fb398382d3373f808b2a43b48b5846a245a299ed0c8c43691c0b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fe45125a6a18f7acf2125db96adef81fa241b8cc5e006e475e854b471937ddca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "膚敏之德，發憤忘食。虜豹擒越，為王得福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7623b91f462c982cdd648e5fceb1b7964ba0fd75fe3a12db9f0778ce4cd7687b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c1c14d7a5e25fffde1eed57d8f3dd09951ef4dee39ba30b759b0d341f4188eda"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "百足俱行，相輔為強。三聖翼事，王室寵光，國富民康。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d30c3765f9353b0e597b415e8158332aef8396a15db4d6aaff926aa9cb8140cd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b591d8c0773c397c7c98478c13b7e29b17a2151c8bb07af30fa3439a85c06313"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "生不逢時，困且多憂。年老衰極，中心悲愁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:36c24c4752aa2e3a94324325165c4a1212b221cb2f42b10682ac4704364e5759",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:704072f950bb5bc966cefd9c9519752c8b79bf06f206a65c9f8cefb00bc38ec2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "出門蹉跌，看道後旅。買羊逸亡，所謂逃走。空手握拳，坐狼為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:35dac0f243b7ba91a090bbbb41886c64e363c75e18f9db4bbcaeea9eba0d9059",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:869f8c24ec54cccac1343989c3972d1e6427f52bedb76e9c200a60e08c20cbbd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "牧羊稻田，聞虎喧讙。畏懼惕息，終無禍患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3f5d8c95c6af1cfd1996eee82f501efa18f4e654d9543dcc19be8f7bd05bfbd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ccfbb80a3194ec74bfb21b056d41e6260e92eeebb7dc5669b53fbaaf794cc7e4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "龍潛鳳池，箕子變服，陰孽萌作。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb38d8a71ba6b5b1f3385c8a606a61f810f43a817f4baa8581c623c9a6d4f8df",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b61d037af0b084b3fb238b5f0765848cb99c2734db0e5b1543967fb17b65ebd6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 61,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "國無比鄰，相與爭強。紛紛凶凶，天下擾攘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f8a8f7378da0fb69cb91023c7865f17c379854afe5a81635faebc39ff982140",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:45e752d67335b65975a22056f6bd8d357baf9ed0423db63bf0d300f90a4ef18a"
    }
  ]
}
